---
title: Voice Room — Live Voice Chat · danbot lab
description: "A browser voice chat room for up to 6 people. Talk in real time with a per-person volume slider for everyone, mixed live on the server. No download, no sign-up."
extraCss:
  - /games/voice/voice.css
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<main class="page">
    <article class="markdown-body voice-wrap">
        <h1 style="text-align:center;">Voice Room</h1>
        <p id="status-banner" class="status-banner"></p>

        <!-- Join -->
        <div id="join-view" class="join-card">
            <p class="room-count" id="room-count"></p>
            <p>Join a live voice room with up to 6 people. Your mic is gated by
               voice activity, and everyone is mixed together on the server so
               you can set a volume for each person.</p>
            <input type="text" id="name-input" placeholder="Your name…" maxlength="16"
                   autocomplete="off">
            <div id="join-error" class="join-error"></div>
            <button id="join-btn" class="vc-btn">🎙️ Join voice</button>
        </div>

        <!-- In the room -->
        <div id="room-view" class="room-card hidden">
            <p class="room-count" id="room-count-live"></p>

            <div class="space-wrap">
                <canvas id="space" class="space-canvas" tabindex="0"
                        aria-label="Proximity chat space — use WASD or arrow keys to walk"></canvas>
            </div>
            <p class="space-hint">Use <kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd>
               or the arrow keys to walk. People sound louder the closer you stand.</p>

            <div id="participants" class="participants"></div>

            <div class="self-controls">
                <button id="mic-toggle" class="mic-toggle">🎙️ Mic live</button>
                <div class="mic-meter"><div id="mic-meter-bar" class="mic-meter-bar"></div></div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:1rem;">
                <button id="leave-btn" class="vc-btn secondary">Leave room</button>
            </div>

            <p class="proximity-note">Volume now follows proximity automatically. The
               sliders below are a personal trim on top — boost or quiet someone
               regardless of where they stand.</p>
        </div>
    </article>
</main>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
<script type="module" src="/games/voice/voice.js"></script>
{% endblock %}
